": "38347751224815589", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_38347751238148921_5057248519300288108_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JVdX_zCKd_UQ7kNvwGk36M2&_nc_oc=AdpEJfa8tOCfnRzFwHMY0GpBY1VmX9u8Pp2fnzBYCIfOChENlWfJqJ2h8xFe03G_oxE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE0lhIB_a-mV9ThLFUt-7p6UxnlyNpgjT0IEyl7tC29zQ&oe=6A9166D7"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot2-lane_1.png", "id": "1344809297858874", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1344809301192207_4447666598631232526_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rsINPVIwQjEQ7kNvwF-LTIu&_nc_oc=AdpLVWZIxagqOlsR1WqMLLC-u5kUOgYJU1WLoJv9S65cZA0yKb_Rpxph-xPMp0IaCQc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF6K9lfTjbklhISs27m182OhSz4KdU3CBRq8vRB7DpBTw&oe=6A9170CB"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot3-depth-alt_1.png", "id": "1040915801870464", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_1040915808537130_4781429846582066514_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zeg6qeg2KbYQ7kNvwFcGHvA&_nc_oc=AdqYi7jpq_Wyt2zx3YtHabi3kIDCmz7k9mKG45pEjntvs-uU9wqwAY_iJ-Z7ARWwFuU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEPmz08E4JgJUcob4ofEgaaWphSvHgnDd3n7rLWHNxrBg&oe=6A9171CE"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot4-score_1.png", "id": "27554383440855653", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_27554383447522319_1875656870862086556_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5Kk3ODBWRTYQ7kNvwEXfxad&_nc_oc=Adrilnqr3mz3PAScqjSRBy9ss6fvF-s2taYhc9Pb5q_pPWp9BtBJRnuUdWJSr5wLiOE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE4sVhh8JN1HzdnA58cP-kZ6lpggwiR1G_s0wx2h0VbQA&oe=6A915AF6"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot5-rest_1.png", "id": "1706333930584924", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_1706333933918257_8714833817623575886_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TdqR6AfmXvMQ7kNvwEhNtc1&_nc_oc=AdoYWZHSo7sFXks2Xg2FvKX6wQIuaki_g3HlbE2g8pWFsb4kN4JTzJvPSjK8fkw5qQw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE_yb4oxrkIuTZiqiluotnVs70nre9mflZPikGEyxEEKA&oe=6A9166D4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AxeArcade_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1061070172992027", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1061070176325360_7984314788343204879_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_h_LGihYXy4Q7kNvwG7iyzk&_nc_oc=Adq9L3R9OfRFkHBvbVKwAqJsPd-069LWkm16LK13J5G-JTQkK3PZ6ODIXX-rEDOdEls&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG6LR27erZ91mEYTQSXFtWyn3T5fM276YD-M66ulgwqbQ&oe=6A917C13"}, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "keywords": ["axe", "throwing", "arcade", "bullseye", "casual"], "long_description": "**How good is your throw?**\n\nPick up an axe with a natural grip, feel its weight as you wind up, and send it spinning end-over-end into the board. Every throw is pure physics and timing \u2014 nail the bullseye for the big score and chase a higher total round after round.\n\n## What you do\n- Grab the axe anywhere on the handle \u2014 grip button, either hand.\n- Wind up and release with a real throwing motion; the axe flies the way you throw it.\n- Hit the target board \u2014 the closer to the bullseye, the bigger the score.\n- Ten throws a round. Beat your high score.\n\n## Pick your challenge\n- Four difficulty tiers: EASY, NORMAL, VIKING and BERSERKER.\n- Two venues to throw in \u2014 the Training Field and Fjord Lane.\n- Fjord Lane adds a distance ladder: land a scoring hit and the board steps farther away.\n- Leaderboards for your best rounds.\n\n## Built for comfort\n- Play seated or standing \u2014 everything is within arm's reach.\n- No artificial movement, no smooth turning, no vection. Comfortable rating.\n- Simple to learn, satisfying to master.", "short_description": "Grab an axe, wind up, and let it fly \u2014 sink bullseyes and climb the high-sco